    "zh": "按“先用后玩”读：左组是路径/跨场景常驻/日志/事件/资源/对象池等全局底座，第二组是 UI 与输入，第三组是本地化与设置，最后一组是面向玩法的层——局外世界地图服务加局内地图生成、音频、存档、对话与自测；箭头是子模块之间的调用/引用关系。",
    "en": "Read left to right: global foundations (paths, cross-scene persistence, logging, events, resources, pool), then UI & input, then localization & settings, and finally the gameplay-facing layer - the world map service plus in-run map generation, audio, save, dialogue and dev-test probes. Arrows are call/reference links between submodules."
